{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And you shall do My statutes.</b> The shemittah and yovel mentioned here, for they are among the statutes. <b>And you shall keep My ordinances,</b> these are the laws of the return of sold properties and slaves in the yovel, and the laws of fraud, for all of them are mentioned in this parashah. <b>And you shall dwell securely on the land,</b> for Israel are exiled from the land on account of the sin of shemittah, as it says (Leviticus 26:34): ״אז תשבת הארץ והרצת את שבתותיה״, and the seventy years of the Babylonian exile were nothing other than corresponding to the seventy shemittot that had been neglected."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:28:19.194618267Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}